CORE
main.c
--pointer-check
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[main\.precondition_instance\.1\].*static array parameter x.*: FAILURE$
^\[main\.precondition_instance\.2\].*static array parameter x.*: FAILURE$
^\[main\.precondition_instance\.3\].*static array parameter x.*: FAILURE$
^\[main\.precondition_instance\.4\].*static array parameter x.*: FAILURE$
^\*\* 4 of \d+ failed
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Static minima survive compatible declarations before and after a definition,
parameter renaming, and selection of the largest declared constant minimum.
